# Defensive: someone running the smoke test at the repo root.
# Leading `/` anchors to the repo root only — without it, the pattern
# also matches templates/workspace/runs/, dropping the shipped skeleton's
# runs/ placeholder from the package.
/runs/
/solid_gemc/

